FLOW: family-chat-telegram.qa.flow
DESCRIPTION: Optional — the whole family talks to Sylvester on Telegram (DMs and a family group) and plans meals together
LAST UPDATED: 2026-10-20

NOTE: Expected behaviour is event-driven, like any chat: a message arrives and Sylvester answers it —
not a clock that checks every few minutes. Grok Bot has no Telegram channel, but a routine can be started
by a webhook call (POST with "Authorization: Bearer <key>"). Telegram's setWebhook cannot send that
header, so a tiny always-on relay (e.g. a free Cloudflare Worker) receives Telegram's call, checks
Telegram's secret header and forwards the update to the routine's webhook. The owner manages everything
(who has access, settings, logins) in the Grok Bot app, never from Telegram.

================================================================================
SECTION 1: CONNECTING TELEGRAM
================================================================================

TEST: "Connect a Telegram bot — happy path"

PRECONDITIONS:
- Sylvester is set up; I use the Grok Bot desktop app (webhook keys are only shown on desktop)

STEP 1: "Create the Telegram bot"
WHEN I open @BotFather in Telegram and send /newbot with a name and username
THEN BotFather gives me a token

STEP 2: "Hand Sylvester the token"
WHEN I write "forbind Telegram" to Sylvester
THEN he opens a token page on his computer and asks me to tap Take over
WHEN I paste the token, save, and tap "I'm done"
THEN the page shows ✅ with the bot's @username, and the token never appears in the chat

STEP 3: "Wire up instant delivery"
THEN Sylvester guides me through the one-time relay setup and the routine's webhook
AND he confirms with a test message to me on Telegram

RESULT: Telegram is connected and messages reach Sylvester as they arrive.

================================================================================
SECTION 2: WHO MAY TALK TO SYLVESTER
================================================================================

TEST: "Owner says hello"

STEP 1: "First message"
WHEN I send /start to the bot from my phone
THEN Sylvester asks me in the Grok Bot app whether that Telegram user is me
WHEN I say yes
THEN he greets me on Telegram within seconds

RESULT: The owner is recognised; nobody else is answered yet.

================================================================================

TEST: "Partner and children join"

STEP 1: "Partner writes"
WHEN my partner writes to the bot
THEN Sylvester asks me in the Grok Bot app: "Mette skrev til Sylvester på Telegram — skal hun have adgang? Voksen eller barn?"
AND my partner gets no answer until I approve
WHEN I answer "ja, voksen"
THEN Sylvester answers her pending message

STEP 2: "Child writes"
WHEN my 12-year-old writes and I approve them as "barn"
THEN Sylvester answers them by name

RESULT: Access is per person, approved by the owner only.

================================================================================

TEST: "Stranger writes"

STEP 1: "Unknown sender"
WHEN someone I don't know finds the bot and writes to it
THEN they get no answer
AND I am asked once in the Grok Bot app; if I say no, they are blocked silently

RESULT: The bot can't be used by strangers.

================================================================================

TEST: "Approval requested from Telegram"

STEP 1: "Someone tries to grant access in Telegram"
WHEN an approved family member writes "giv Peter adgang" on Telegram
THEN Sylvester says only the owner can do that in the Grok Bot app

RESULT: Settings never change from a Telegram message.

================================================================================
SECTION 3: PLANNING TOGETHER
================================================================================

TEST: "Family group — planning the week"

PRECONDITIONS:
- The bot is in our family group, approved by me; partner and children approved

STEP 1: "Wishes from several people"
WHEN my partner writes "@Sylvester kan vi få laks på onsdag?"
AND my child replies "og pizza fredag!"
THEN Sylvester answers in the group within seconds, by name, and takes both wishes into the plan

STEP 2: "Plan in the group"
WHEN I write "@Sylvester lav planen for næste uge"
THEN the meal-plan card is posted in the group with the wishes on their days

STEP 3: "Normal chatter"
WHEN family members chat in the group without addressing Sylvester
THEN he stays silent

RESULT: The family shapes the week together in their own group.

================================================================================

TEST: "Roles: child cannot change the basket"

STEP 1: "Child asks to shop"
WHEN my child writes "@Sylvester fyld kurven med slik"
THEN Sylvester says nicely that a grown-up needs to ask, and notes the wish
AND the basket is unchanged

STEP 2: "Adult asks to shop"
WHEN my partner writes "@Sylvester fyld kurven"
THEN he fills the basket and posts the item list and total in the group (meal-plan-and-basket.qa.flow)
AND still never orders

RESULT: Children can wish; adults can shop; nobody can order through Sylvester.

================================================================================

TEST: "Photos and voice"

STEP 1: "Photo"
WHEN someone sends a photo of the fridge and asks "hvad kan vi lave?"
THEN Sylvester uses the photo in his answer

STEP 2: "Voice message"
WHEN someone sends a voice message
THEN he asks them to write it instead

RESULT: Photos work; voice is politely declined.

================================================================================

TEST: "Weekly plan to the group"

PRECONDITIONS:
- Saturday routine enabled (meal-plan-and-basket.qa.flow SECTION 3)

STEP 1: "Saturday"
WHEN Saturday 09:00 comes
THEN the meal-plan card is posted in the family group

RESULT: The whole family sees the week's plan.

================================================================================
SECTION 4: TURNING IT OFF
================================================================================

TEST: "Remove a person / stop Telegram"

STEP 1: "Remove someone"
WHEN I tell Sylvester in the Grok Bot app "fjern Peter fra Telegram"
THEN Peter's messages are no longer answered

STEP 2: "Stop entirely"
WHEN I tell Sylvester "sluk Telegram"
THEN the routine is paused and nobody gets answers on Telegram
AND everything else keeps working in the Grok Bot app

RESULT: Telegram is fully under the owner's control.
